# CR 616.1: an unblocked Grizzly Bears (2 power) would deal 2 combat damage to
# the AI while Furnace of Rath ("double") and Thor, Asgard's Avenger ("another
# source you control: plus 1") both replace it. Candidate 0 is Furnace of
# Rath: 2 -> 4, then Thor's plus 1 applies to what is left: 5. AI life
# 20 - 5 = 15.
queue replacement 0
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 3
declareattackers
advance
queue blocks none
declareblockers
advance
advance
combatdamage
